# The host links with -z now: a symbol missing from an older WebKitGTK stops it from starting,
# WebKitGTK symbols arctic-webapp-host may call (webkit_test.go checks the build against this).
# so every addition must exist in WebKitGTK 2.50 (Fedora 44 shipped 2.52 before 2.54), or the
# spec's webkitgtk6.0 floor must rise with it. 2.54-only features go through property names.
